---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Ashmit Bohora Resume | UT Austin Data Science, Software & AI"
  description="Resume of Ashmit Bohora, a UT Austin Statistics & Data Science student (Class of 2029): growth & AI automation at WLF Club, founder of Webspansion and Prospansion, builder of Warvis, Kiln, Guruji, and BohoQuest."
>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <header class="site">
    <div class="wrap masthead">
      <a class="title" href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">Ashmit <span>Bohora</span></a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNav">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
      <nav aria-label="Main" id="mainNav">
        <div class="nav-sections">
          <a href="/">Full site</a>
          <a href="/#shipped">Shipped</a>
          <a href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PDF version</a>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-icons">
          <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.3C4.3 1.3 1.3 4.3 1.3 8c0 3 1.9 5.4 4.5 6.3.3.1.5-.1.5-.4v-1.4c-1.8.4-2.2-.8-2.2-.8-.3-.8-.7-1-.7-1-.6-.4.1-.4.1-.4.6 0 1 .6 1 .6.6 1 1.5.7 1.9.5.1-.4.2-.7.4-.9-1.5-.2-3-.7-3-3.3 0-.7.3-1.3.6-1.8-.1-.2-.3-.9.1-1.8 0 0 .5-.2 1.7.6.5-.1 1-.2 1.5-.2s1 .1 1.5.2c1.2-.8 1.7-.6 1.7-.6.4.9.1 1.6.1 1.8.4.5.6 1.1.6 1.8 0 2.6-1.5 3.1-3 3.3.2.2.4.5.4 1.1v1.6c0 .3.2.5.5.4 2.6-.9 4.5-3.3 4.5-6.3 0-3.7-3-6.7-6.7-6.7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.3" y="1.3" width="13.4" height="13.4" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="5" cy="5.2" r="0.9" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M5 7.3v4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 11.5V8.8c0-1 .7-1.6 1.6-1.6.9 0 1.4.6 1.4 1.6v2.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 7.3v4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="wrap resume-head">
      <h1>Ashmit Bohora <span class="lit">Resume</span></h1>
      <p class="resume-dek">
        UT Austin Statistics &amp; Data Science, Class of 2029. Seeking Summer 2027 internships in
        data science, software engineering, machine learning, or AI. The same one-pager recruiters
        get, as a real page.
      </p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download PDF</a>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">Email me</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="sheet" aria-label="Resume of Ashmit Bohora">
        <header class="sheet-head">
          <p class="sheet-name">Ashmit Bohora</p>
          <p class="sheet-contact">
            Austin, TX &middot; <a href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">ashmitbohora@utexas.edu</a>
            &middot; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora</a>
            &middot; <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/ashmitbohora</a>
            &middot; <a href="/">ashmitbohora.com</a>
          </p>
          <p class="sheet-tagline">CS student and AI engineer building local-first AI systems (Warvis), growth and automation infrastructure, and free community tech (Webspansion, Guruji)</p>
        </header>

        <h2>Education</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">The University of Texas at Austin <span class="sub">&middot; B.S. Statistics and Data Science</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Expected May 2029 &middot; GPA 3.75/4.0</span>
          </div>
          <p class="honors">QuestBridge Finalist (2024) &middot; UT Austin Impact Scholar ($48,000 merit award) &middot; Thomas &amp; Elizabeth Merner Scholarship in Natural Sciences ($2,000, 2026&ndash;2027)</p>
          <p class="honors">Coursework: Elements of Software Design, Linear Algebra, Probability &amp; Statistical Inference (Fall 2026) &middot; Intro to Data Science, Statistical Thinking, Multivariable Calculus</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Growth &amp; AI Automation <span class="sub">&middot; WLF Club</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Fort Worth, TX &middot; May 2026 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Redirected WLF's growth strategy from ad spend to backlog conversion by analyzing 780+ CRM opportunities in GoHighLevel, finding 95% never reached a decision despite a 92% win rate when worked</li>
            <li>Automated WLF's institutional knowledge access by training an internal RAG AI (Warvis) on the business's own data and building it into daily workflows, alongside a 25-module staff training site and an internal ops dashboard (React, Vite, Supabase)</li>
            <li>Captured 588 users and 1,109 pageviews in a 28-day window by standing up WLF's full analytics stack (GA4, Search Console, Clarity, Meta Pixel) across the site and three lead-generation funnels, verifying 12 of 12 attribution fields end to end</li>
            <li>Replaced $150/hour agency billing by auditing and fixing a $15,000 agency-built website in-house: publishing 12 unfinished pages, repairing broken routes, and adding schema/SEO markup</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Webspansion &amp; Prospansion <span class="sub">&middot; Founder</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Euless, TX &middot; Apr 2024 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="k">Webspansion (free tier):</span> founded a pro bono, accessibility-first web studio as community service, shipping 19+ free live websites (intake through deploy) for nonprofits, immigrant-owned local businesses, and community groups</li>
            <li><span class="k">Prospansion (paid tier):</span> the technical/data arm, offering analytics (GA4, Microsoft Clarity, GTM), SEO, and automation; built its technical flagship, Prospansion Studio, a multi-tenant Cloudflare Workers + D1 CMS giving paying clients self-serve site editing, with hardened auth (invite-only signup, hashed tokens, single-use resets) and a fixed sanitizer-bypass XSS vulnerability (allowlist parser, verified via exploit proof-of-fix), deployed for nonprofit client Ocura</li>
            <li>Drove SEO and brand imagery at scale by writing 23+ optimized blog posts and 8 case studies, and automating OG/blog-hero image generation (Python, Playwright, Pillow, fal.ai)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Local-First AI &amp; Knowledge Systems <span class="sub">&middot; Warvis, Kiln</span></span>
            <span class="meta">TypeScript &middot; RAG / Local Training</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech">Next.js, TypeScript, libSQL/SQLite, Transformers.js, Ollama/MLX, LoRA</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Built Warvis, a RAG knowledge system ingesting 700+ documents into a cited, hybrid-search graph (SQLite FTS5 + local embeddings), enforcing a HIPAA-aware PHI-scanning gate and fail-closed, tiered access control on every query (229 passing tests)</li>
            <li>Raised a local model's eval score from 0.84 to 0.99 by building Kiln, a self-improving training loop where a frontier model teaches a small local model (Qwen2.5, Ollama/MLX) gated against a held-out baseline, which also correctly rejected and rolled back a regressed candidate after a crash</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="also">Also built: BoHub (personal local-AI OS) and a simplified household version for my family (bills, insurance, remittances) on the same local-first architecture</p>
        </section>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Shipped Production Apps <span class="sub">&middot; Guruji, BohoQuest</span></span>
            <span class="meta">React &middot; Expo/React Native &middot; Supabase</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="k">Guruji (<a href="https://getguruji.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getguruji.com</a>):</span> built and deployed a free, gamified Duolingo-style community-education PWA (React, TypeScript, Supabase) with RLS-scoped auth, AA-verified UI, and a self-run security audit against the live database (zero exploitable vulnerabilities)</li>
            <li>Drove real impact: a cousin used Guruji to realize he was overpaying an agency $100+/month for work he could do himself and canceled, saving $1,200+ a year</li>
            <li>Authored Guruji's multi-track curriculum, naming Data Decoded (data science) and QuickClaude (coding) as tracks alongside English and digital-literacy content</li>
            <li><span class="k">BohoQuest (<a href="https://app.bohoquest.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">app.bohoquest.app</a>):</span> shipped a gamified check-in app (Expo/React Native) with server-side anti-cheat verification (Supabase RPC), Apple Sign-In, and a 121-test suite; live in TestFlight</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="also">Also: PickMyPath (<a href="https://app.pickmypath.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">app.pickmypath.app</a>, live, paused). BohoQuest is part of the Boho family alongside BohoBites (food/content, 6K+ followers) and Bohos BTS (behind-the-scenes content)</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Leadership &amp; Skills</h2>
        <section class="block skills">
          <p><span class="k">Community, DFW &amp; NST Mandir (2021&ndash;Present):</span> co-led youth programs raising $10,000+; ran logistics for health camps, blood drives, and community events; extended free education (Guruji) and free websites (Webspansion) to nonprofits, immigrant-owned businesses, and community groups</p>
          <p><span class="k">Languages:</span> Python, R, SQL, TypeScript, JavaScript &nbsp;|&nbsp; Pandas, NumPy, Plotly, Shiny, FastAPI</p>
          <p><span class="k">Frameworks &amp; data:</span> React 19, Next.js 16, Astro, Tailwind &middot; Supabase/PostgreSQL, SQLite/libSQL &middot; GoHighLevel, GA4</p>
          <p><span class="k">AI &amp; tooling:</span> Claude Code, Codex, Claude &amp; Gemini APIs, RAG, LoRA fine-tuning &middot; Git, Playwright, Vercel, Cloudflare</p>
          <p><span class="k">Spoken:</span> English, Nepali (fluent); Hindi, Spanish (intermediate)</p>
        </section>
      </article>

      <div class="sheet-foot">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Ashmit Bohora's resume as a PDF</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/">See the full portfolio</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="sig">Chef &amp; engineer: <span>Ashmit Bohora</span>, Austin TX</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume PDF</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">Email</a>
        <a href="/#brands">Social Media</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fineprint">Every line on this page is measured, not garnished.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const navToggle = document.getElementById('navToggle') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const mainNav = document.getElementById('mainNav')!;
    navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = mainNav.classList.toggle('open');
      navToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    });
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  .resume-head {
    padding-block: 56px 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .resume-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .resume-dek {
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .resume-head .cta {
    margin-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sheet {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 2.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
    padding: clamp(24px, 4.5vw, 48px);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .sheet-name {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sheet-contact {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .sheet-contact a {
    color: var(--ketchup);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mustard);
  }
  .sheet-contact a:hover { border-color: var(--ketchup); }
  .sheet-tagline {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .sheet-head { padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ketchup); }

  .sheet h2 {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ketchup);
    margin: 26px 0 10px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #e2d6bc;
  }
  .block { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .role { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .role .sub { font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tech {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .sheet ul { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .sheet li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin: 6px 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sheet li::before {
    content: "\00b7";
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    color: var(--ketchup);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sheet li a, .also a {
    color: var(--ketchup);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mustard);
  }
  .sheet li a:hover, .also a:hover { border-color: var(--ketchup); }
  .honors { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; }
  .also { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
  .k { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .skills p { margin: 7px 0; }

  .sheet-foot {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 30px auto 80px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .meta { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>
